@startuml
title 按键翻页 —— 任务时序图

participant "机械按键\n(PB0)" as BTN
participant "EXTI0 中断\n(ISR)" as ISR
participant "Task_Display\n(优先级 1)" as DISP
participant "OLED\n(软件模拟 I2C)" as OLED

== 空闲 ==

note over BTN, OLED: 按键未按下，PB0 被内部上拉拉高
DISP -> DISP: xQueueReceive(超时 100ms)\n没数据，转去检查按键
DISP -> DISP: xTaskNotifyWait(超时 0)\n没通知，回到循环开头

== 按下按键 ==

BTN -> ISR: PB0 由高变低（下降沿）
activate ISR
ISR -> ISR: ① 确认中断源
ISR -> ISR: ② 双重确认电平为低
ISR -> ISR: ③ 消抖：距上次 <200ms 则丢弃
ISR -> DISP: ④ xTaskNotifyFromISR(BTN_LEFT)
ISR -> ISR: ⑤ 清中断挂起位（必须！）
deactivate ISR

== 任务响应 ==

DISP -> DISP: xTaskNotifyWait 取出通知\n并清除 bit0 / bit1
DISP -> DISP: Menu_HandleEvent(BTN_LEFT)\n光照页 → 系统页

DISP -> OLED: OLED_Clear()
activate OLED
OLED --> DISP: 完成
deactivate OLED

DISP -> OLED: Menu_RenderCurrentPage()\n逐字符写屏
activate OLED
OLED --> DISP: 完成
deactivate OLED

@enduml
